  "description": "AULTEN Inverter Model No.- AD052 1100VA Solar Hybrid Inverter Equipped with latest technology which have >94% high-efficiency, PWM charging technology. Controller-based unique design and Pure Sine Wave output with 100% solar panel tracking. Designed with multifunctional LCD display for a better user interface. It displays parameters like the battery voltage, charging current, output voltage, input voltage, solar voltage, solar current, the amount of solar power consumed, etc. Aulten solar inverter prioritizes the use of solar power over grid power in order to reduce grid consumption. It uses grid power only when the solar power is insufficient to meet the load requirement. Supports various types of batteries such as Lead Acid Tubular Batteries, Sealed Maintenance Free Batteries (SMF), Flat Batteries, Gel Batteries and also comes with 2 charging modes such as High Charging mode to charge your batteries quickly @ 17 Amperes +/- 2 Amps or Normal Charging @ 15 Amps +/- 2 Amps 2 years Replacement Warranty. Note: This 2-year warranty policy updated on 3rd 2023 May, buyers who purchased this product earlier before the new warranty policy will not be able to claim this offer",
